{
  "voice": null,
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "他逃上大西洋邮轮，以为这片海，能藏住自己。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "可一道电波，已经跑在了他的前面。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九一零年一月三十一日，伦敦的小楼里，聚会正热闹。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "女歌手科拉放声高歌，丈夫克里平，却安静地坐在角落。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "可聚会之后，科拉再没露面，只留下了她的舞台帽。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "几周后，情人伊瑟尔住了进来，戴上科拉的首饰。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "丈夫先说科拉回了美国，后来又说她病死，朋友们起了疑心。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "她们报了警，苏格兰场的杜探长，开始调查这场失踪。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "探长上门，克里平温和应答，第一次搜查，一无所获。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "可调查之后，这对情人突然不见了。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "两人的消失，让探长折返回去，这次，他走向地下煤窖。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他撬开松动的砖地，看到地下的东西，脸色变得凝重。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "地下发现了遗骸，警方封锁现场，消息很快传遍伦敦。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "检验发现了剧毒药物，警方随即发出通缉令。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "七月二十日，两人化名罗宾逊父子，登上蒙特罗斯号。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "船长肯德尔，却留意上了这对举止奇怪的父子。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "男孩的裤脚靠别针固定，两人牵手的动作，又过分亲密。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "船长翻开通缉报纸，认出了这对逃亡者。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "他让电报员向英国发报，一道电波，越过了大西洋。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "无线电，把海上的线索送到警方手里，杜探长立即出发。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "他登上更快的劳伦蒂克号，要赶在两人前面。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "一边还在悠闲看海，另一边，已经抢先抵达加拿大。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "七月三十一日清晨，探长换上引航员制服，在父亲角等候。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "小船靠上蒙特罗斯号，探长登船，走到毫无防备的克里平身后。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "帽子摘下，身份揭晓。这场跨海逃亡，终于结束了。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "十月，克里平在老贝利受审，陪审团开始商议判决。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "仅二十七分钟，他被裁定有罪。伊瑟尔另案受审，获判无罪。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "十一月二十三日，克里平被处决，故事似乎画上了句号。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "可二〇〇七年的DNA研究提出：地窖里的人，可能不是科拉。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "结论仍有争议，未能推翻原判。科拉，究竟在哪？",
      "voice_id": null,
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "sha256": null
    }
  ]
}
